1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 21=

10
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:02,840
At last, you're mine.

11
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,150
How come it's you?

12
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,870
Of course it's me.

13
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,480
This is ridiculous!

14
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,710
You actually think

15
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,360
you can raid
the Court of Judicial Review?

16
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,790
Stay right where you are.

17
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:30,070
This mission is dangerous.

18
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:31,560
We all know that.

19
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,760
But we must repay

20
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,150
her kindness.

21
00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:37,860
If anyone is to be rescued,
it's not your place to do it.

22
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,070
In the past,

23
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,680
you were nothing but a dog

24
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,590
wagging its tail and begging at my feet.

25
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,120
And now you've learned
to betray your master.

26
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,790
You made me use these hands
that play the guqin

27
00:02:00,790 --> 00:02:01,760
to kill,

28
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:03,310
and then treated me like a plaything,

29
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,990
and handed me over to
Prince Cheng so casually.

30
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,560
You made me suffer
through endless misery.

31
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,790
Have you forgotten all of that?

32
00:02:10,030 --> 00:02:11,630
No wonder Qi Yuan doesn't like you.

33
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:13,190
After all,

34
00:02:13,310 --> 00:02:14,430
you are nothing but

35
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:15,870
a pitiful wretch

36
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,000
who depends on your mother's favor

37
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,120
and begs for your father's attention.

38
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,080
I can strangle you

39
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,360
right now.

40
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,600
Do you think I'm afraid of you?

41
00:02:23,430 --> 00:02:25,080
Once I put on this bridal gown,

42
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,430
I never intended to
walk out of here alive.

43
00:02:28,630 --> 00:02:30,150
You are nothing more than an ant.

44
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:33,750
You.

45
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:36,190
You are mad!

46
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:37,360
Guards!

47
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,560
- I am mad.
- Guards!

48
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:39,710
Didn't you say

49
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,910
I'm yours

50
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:42,280
for all our lives?

51
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:57,840
Yuan,

52
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,800
I have won this time.

53
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:06,710
Your Highness,

54
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,150
Prince Jing has rebelled!

55
00:03:09,510 --> 00:03:10,910
Come with me at once to the palace.

56
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,310
We'll protect His Majesty.

57
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:16,430
Your Majesty,

58
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:18,840
I had no choice.

59
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,240
I only hope

60
00:03:20,250 --> 00:03:21,400
you'll give the Qi family a chance

61
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,800
to clear their name.

62
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,310
You...

63
00:03:24,570 --> 00:03:25,970
I have come to rescue you, Father.

64
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,560
Father.

65
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,030
Xiao Yunting,

66
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:30,120
your ambitions are plain for all to see.

67
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:32,400
Today, I will cleanse the court for Father

68
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,030
and remove the traitors.

69
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:34,960
Guards!

70
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,680
Take this rebel down for me.

71
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:38,710
Stop!

72
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:44,910
Your Majesty,

73
00:03:45,870 --> 00:03:48,310
the bandit attack wasn't what it seemed.

74
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,910
This is the proof.

75
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:53,870
Consort Great Liu's final letter.

76
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,310
What?

77
00:03:59,230 --> 00:04:00,520
Your Majesty, please see clearly.

78
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,310
The bandit attack back then

79
00:04:02,310 --> 00:04:04,870
was in fact secretly planned

80
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:06,240
by my own younger sister,

81
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,150
Consort Little Liu.

82
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,560
I thought I could finally

83
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,190
have the chance

84
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,960
to tell you the truth

85
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,030
when I return to the palace
and see Your Majesty.

86
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,600
Give it here.

87
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:19,480
(But there were wicked people
with ulterior motives)

88
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,000
(who poisoned my food and drink.)

89
00:04:22,830 --> 00:04:24,830
(Aside from my sister,)

90
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,510
(there could be no one else.)

91
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:29,830
(I know my time is almost up.)

92
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,600
(I have only one wish.)

93
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:34,430
(For the sake of the years
we shared as husband and wife,)

94
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:36,360
(please uncover the truth
about what happened that year)

95
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,190
(and bring the real culprit to justice.)

96
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,040
(This will be)

97
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:42,070
(my final letter.)

98
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:45,190
I have failed you, Liu.

99
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,360
It cannot be.

100
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:47,160
This is fake.

101
00:04:47,310 --> 00:04:48,240
This must be fake.

102
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:48,800
Get off!

103
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:55,190
Your Majesty, you must
get to the bottom of this,

104
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:59,000
so that the soul of Prince Consort
and Commandery Princess will rest in peace.

105
00:04:59,190 --> 00:05:00,270
I'm innocent.

106
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:01,240
I didn't do it.

107
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,040
You liar!

108
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,920
This poem was written

109
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:08,240
by Liu and me in our youth.

110
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,680
Only she and I knew it.

111
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:12,240
Consort Little Liu,

112
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:15,600
you poisoned your own sister.

113
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:20,800
I'll have the entire Liu family
stripped of its titles and exiled.

114
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,750
You will be sent to the Cold Palace.

115
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,920
Useless fool!

116
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,870
If you had listened to me

117
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,310
and finished off Qi Yuan,

118
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:41,390
we would never have ended up like this.

119
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,160
Now,

120
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,920
go and kill them all.

121
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,120
Otherwise,

122
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,680
we will all die.

123
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,310
Everyone?

124
00:05:53,510 --> 00:05:56,480
That includes Father too?

125
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,830
Do you think he will spare us?

126
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,800
Prince Qi,

127
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:03,560
do you really think

128
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:05,070
your mother is doing this

129
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,510
to protect you?

130
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,310
She is protecting herself.

131
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,870
Your mother only sees you as a tool

132
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:13,600
for seizing power.

133
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,920
Prince Qi,

134
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:17,270
how pathetic you are.

135
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,870
Is what she said true?

136
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:23,870
You are foolish beyond help.

137
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:26,560
You are not fit to be my son at all.

138
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:29,560
You were actually bound by love.

139
00:06:29,750 --> 00:06:31,120
Let me tell you this.

140
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,750
In this world,

141
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:34,600
the only thing worth pursuing

142
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:37,000
is power.

143
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,560
You!

144
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,920
Only by sitting on the throne

145
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,680
can you have it all.

146
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,120
Kill them.

147
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,950
I told you to kill them!

148
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,360
Mother.

149
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:03,160
I'm merely a pawn to you.

150
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:15,140
(Court of Judicial Review)

151
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:21,800
I heard you've been

152
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,240
living quite comfortably in prison.

153
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,310
You tried to kill me first.

154
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:27,920
What goes around

155
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,070
comes around.

156
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:31,070
Yet you still refuse to repent.

157
00:07:31,270 --> 00:07:32,190
Repent?

158
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,600
Why should I?

159
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,270
Why?

160
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:40,390
In my previous life,
you were no match for me.

161
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,120
I had you and Xiao Yunting

162
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,750
wrapped around my finger.

163
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,390
What do you mean?

164
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,270
Xiao Yunting was so madly in love
with you.

165
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:54,630
On your wedding night,
I lured him away.

166
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:57,310
He didn't tell you the truth

167
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,360
to keep you out of it.

168
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:01,720
He left you alone in the bridal chamber,

169
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:03,870
which made things

170
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:08,070
much easier for me.

171
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:09,950
What did you do?

172
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,510
What did I do?

173
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:16,750
I deceived both of you.

174
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:20,950
While he was fighting my men
on your wedding night,

175
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:24,560
you believed he'd traded you away

176
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,070
and took your own life.

177
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,430
You were both fools.

178
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,240
You are fools!

179
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:33,440
Fools!

180
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,200
You lunatic!

181
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:39,720
Go on.

182
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,200
Kill me!

183
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,750
Don't worry.

184
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,750
I won't kill you.

185
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,030
Killing you

186
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,510
would only dirty my blade.

187
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:59,480
I want you to suffer a fate
worse than death.

188
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:01,790
Qi Yuan,

189
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:07,000
I love you no less
than Xiao Yunting does.

190
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,910
Why are you so cruel to me?

191
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,120
I know you're going to him.

192
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:12,720
I won't let you.

193
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:13,600
You're mine.

194
00:09:13,790 --> 00:09:14,630
Mine!

195
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,320
Love?

196
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:16,670
You call that love?

197
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,200
To you,

198
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,550
love is nothing but possession.

199
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,150
Just like your mother.

200
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:23,750
For status,

201
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:25,150
she lost her mind.

202
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:26,200
You were nothing more than

203
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,150
a tool in her hands.

204
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,030
She kept you when she needed you,

205
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:32,150
and discarded you when she didn't.

206
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,270
Is that love?

207
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,550
That's possession.

208
00:09:34,550 --> 00:09:36,960
Neither you nor your mother
ever loved anyone...

209
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,600
Shut up!

210
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,240
That's control.

211
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:38,870
Shut up!

212
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:39,720
Not love.

213
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,120
My mother raised me.

214
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:44,550
She loved me.

215
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,510
My mother loved me.

216
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:51,080
My mother loved me.

217
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:53,720
My mother loved me.

218
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:54,870
She did.

219
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,630
From now on,

220
00:09:57,630 --> 00:09:59,330
you'll spend your days
rotting in this prison.

221
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,720
The status,

222
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,510
power,

223
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:03,440
and wealth you've lost

224
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,840
will torment you every day,

225
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,000
a thousand times,

226
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:10,030
ten thousand times

227
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:11,480
more than I suffered.

228
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,750
My mother loved me!

229
00:10:34,690 --> 00:10:36,000
Prince Qi has taken his own life.

230
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,480
Xiao Yunting!

231
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,750
Xiao Yunting!

232
00:10:50,390 --> 00:10:51,480
Xiao Yunting!

233
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,480
Yunting!

234
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:54,360
Yuan.

235
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:05,960
Yunting.

236
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:11,870
Where did you go?

237
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,870
Are you alright?

238
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:18,550
You...

239
00:11:20,870 --> 00:11:21,790
Are you alright?

240
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,390
I'm fine.

241
00:11:23,390 --> 00:11:24,750
Did I kick you too hard?

242
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,630
Not at all.

243
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,390
Why...

244
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:32,790
Why didn't you answer me
when I called you?

245
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,000
I thought you'd left me.

246
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,670
I've been here all along.

247
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:41,080
There, there.

248
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,440
Don't cry.

249
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,120
I'm sorry.

250
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,120
I've made up my mind.

251
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,550
I want to spend

252
00:12:02,750 --> 00:12:05,600
every lifetime with you.

253
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,120
Alright.

254
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,510
Every lifetime together.

255
00:12:28,910 --> 00:12:33,550
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

256
00:12:33,930 --> 00:12:37,710
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

257
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:43,680
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

258
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:48,060
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

259
00:12:48,850 --> 00:12:53,130
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

260
00:12:53,930 --> 00:13:00,830
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪

261
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:15,120
Qi Yuan,
eldest daughter of the Qi family,

262
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,670
is loyal and upright,

263
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:18,500
protecting the weak
and punishing the wicked.

264
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:20,670
She is truly

265
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:22,270
a heroine among women.

266
00:13:22,730 --> 00:13:25,670
I hereby confer upon her
the title of Marquis Ning'an.

267
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,080
May this seal of nobility

268
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:29,600
honor your righteous spirit forever.

269
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:31,870
Do not disappoint me.

270
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:36,200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

271
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,030
Rise.

272
00:14:02,140 --> 00:14:04,500
(Spring Over Phoenix Pond, Volume 1)

273
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:05,790
What do you think about the story?

274
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:14,360
"The Lady Marquis wept

275
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,870
before the Buddha."

276
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:18,270
I went there to pray for a safety charm.

277
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:20,240
Why would I be crying?

278
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:22,240
Really?

279
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,550
Because I remember

280
00:14:24,790 --> 00:14:26,720
seeing tears on your face.

281
00:14:26,870 --> 00:14:27,600
Besides,

282
00:14:27,700 --> 00:14:29,440
those words before the Buddha
came from you.

283
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,510
That's not true.

284
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:32,030
I never said that.

285
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:40,790
Wait.

286
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,240
I remember

287
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:45,600
I only said those things to you.

288
00:14:45,750 --> 00:14:47,200
How could anyone else know?

289
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:50,030
Eat.

290
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:50,630
Eat up.

291
00:14:51,150 --> 00:14:52,120
Oh, I see.

292
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:55,240
No wonder this storybook says

293
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,630
Prince Jing is brilliant

294
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:58,910
and foresees everything.

295
00:14:58,910 --> 00:14:59,750
So someone

296
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:02,030
has been flattering himself.

297
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,440
My dear, if you're not happy with the story,

298
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:08,000
I'll hire another author

299
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:11,030
to write all about
Marquis Ning'an's greatness,

300
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,200
while Prince Jing

301
00:15:12,270 --> 00:15:14,510
does nothing but peel lotus seeds

302
00:15:14,510 --> 00:15:15,720
and keep her company.

303
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:17,840
Then I'll add this.

304
00:15:17,850 --> 00:15:19,240
Prince Jing mistook salt for sugar

305
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,270
when making soup,

306
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:21,440
and still insisted

307
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,150
it had a unique flavor.

308
00:15:24,030 --> 00:15:25,480
If we're doing this,

309
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,840
then I'll add this.

310
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,120
Look.

311
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,240
You stole my military manual

312
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,600
and read it under the covers all night.

313
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,150
- You nodded off in court the next morning.
- You!

314
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:32,990
- That's mean!
- Can I add that?

315
00:15:33,270 --> 00:15:34,320
That's mean!

316
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:51,860
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

317
00:15:52,240 --> 00:15:56,020
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

318
00:15:56,530 --> 00:16:01,990
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

319
00:16:02,210 --> 00:16:06,370
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

320
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:11,440
♪How I wish to stay only
in the moment with you♪

321
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:19,140
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
